{"id":"b98a63db589b7431","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-setop-intersection-family.md","title":"ZFC Setop Intersection Family","display":"df-zfc-setop-intersection-family — ZFC Setop Intersection Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-setop-intersection-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-setop-intersection-family"],"display":"df-zfc-setop-intersection-family — ZFC Setop Intersection Family","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-setop-intersection-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-setop-intersection-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-setop-intersection-family — ZFC Setop Intersection Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,F,A_0,A,x\\in V\">\\(I,F,A_0,A,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopIntersectionFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopIntersectionFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopIntersectionFamily}_S(I,F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nF\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\exists A_0\\in F\\;\n\\left(I=\\{x\\in A_0\\mid\\forall A\\in F\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopIntersectionFamily}_S(I,F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nF\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\exists A_0\\in F\\;\n\\left(I=\\{x\\in A_0\\mid\\forall A\\in F\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>非空条件保证可以用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\\in F\">\\(A_0\\in F\\)</span> 对交集进行集合界定，避免对真类作无界交。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"I,F,A_0,A,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopIntersectionFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopIntersectionFamily}_S(I,F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nF\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\exists A_0\\in F\\;\n\\left(I=\\{x\\in A_0\\mid\\forall A\\in F\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\right)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A_0\\in F","display":false}],"bytes":818,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3475","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-setop-intersection-family.md|58-df-zfc-setop-intersection-family]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":[]}